{"confidence":1,"needs_review":false,"rationale":"The company's Form 10-K notes for Note 2 (Acquisitions) specifically detail acquisitions in fiscal 2022 (Current Health Ltd. and Yardbird Furniture) and do not report any business combinations/acquisitions for fiscal 2023 or fiscal 2021.","answer":"According to Best Buy's FY2023 Form 10-K (Note 2, Acquisitions), Best Buy did not complete any major acquisitions in FY2023 or FY2021. However, in FY2022, Best Buy completed two major acquisitions:

1. **Current Health Ltd.** – Acquired on November 2, 2021, for net cash consideration of $389 million, adding $351 million of goodwill.
2. **Two Peaks, LLC d/b/a Yardbird Furniture ("Yardbird")** – Acquired on November 4, 2021, for net cash consideration of $79 million, adding $47 million of goodwill.","citations":[{"source_id":"ch_a9dabc57dd7a78f6","quote":"In fiscal 2022, we acquired all of the outstanding shares of Current Health Ltd. (“Current Health”), a care-at-home technology platform, on November 2, 2021, for net cash consideration of $389 million."},{"source_id":"ch_a9dabc57dd7a78f6","quote":"Two Peaks, LLC d/b/a Yardbird Furniture In fiscal 2022, we acquired all of the outstanding shares of Two Peaks, LLC d/b/a Yardbird Furniture (“Yardbird”), a direct-to-consumer outdoor furniture company, on November 4, 2021, for net cash consideration of $79 million."}]}
